# Title: Change Winevt Channel Access Permission Via Registry
# ID: 7d9263bd-dc47-4a58-bc92-5474abab390c
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-09-17
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685.001
# Description: Detects tampering with the "ChannelAccess" registry key in order to change access to Windows event channel.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((registry_key_name="*\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\WINEVT\\Channels\\*" AND registry_key_name="*\\ChannelAccess" AND (Details="*(A;;0x1;;;LA)*" OR Details="*(A;;0x1;;;SY)*" OR Details="*(A;;0x5;;;BA)*")) AND NOT (((process_path="C:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\*" AND process_path="*\\TiWorker.exe") OR (process_path="C:\\Windows\\servicing\\TrustedInstaller.exe"))))
